#N canvas 50 50 1100 720 12;
#X text 30 10 glitch_clock: host-synced 16-step sequencer. Broadcasts: glitch_fx (effect index 0-9 for the current step) \, glitch_stepbang (bang at each step start) \, glitch_stepdur (step length in ms) \, playhead (output param for the GUI).;
#X text 30 60 One step = one 16th note. stepdur = 15000/bpm ms.;
